# Tool Artifacts And Attachments
Some tools may return JSON with `content` and `artifact_candidates`. When the customer asks for a file, image, document, brochure, plan, layout, or other downloadable media, select the relevant `artifact_candidates[].id` values in the final `artifact_ids` field. Do not say that a file was sent unless you include the matching `artifact_ids`. Keep the visible response natural and do not copy raw URLs or `[artifact_candidate:N]` placeholders into it.

